  ("1. The acronym <b>WEIRD</b> describes societies that are Western, Educated, Industrialised, Rich and Democratic.","<b>WEIRD</b> (adj) — a term from Henrich, Heine and Norenzayan (2010) for the unusual populations that supply most psychological data."),
  ("2. A finding is <b>universal</b> if it holds across humanity, not only in one population.","<b>universal</b> (adj) — true or found everywhere. Compare <em>culture-specific</em>."),
